{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist FAQ section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact visual reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Reproduce the same two-column structure, typography, colours, spacing, accordion styling, button shapes, and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify section.
    
    Background colour: warm pale cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 60px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 75px.
    
    Two-column layout.
    
    Left column: approximately 42% width.
    
    Right column: approximately 58% width.
    
    Column gap: 45px.
    
    Vertically align both columns towards the top.
    
    Premium, minimal, Scandinavian-inspired aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – FAQ INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a vertically aligned content block on the left.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    
    "— FAQ"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Small margin below.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Questions?
    We've Got Answers."
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Desktop font size: 38px.
    
    Line height: 1.08.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Maximum width: 400px.
    
    Maintain the exact two-line structure.
    
    Description:
    
    "Can't find what you're looking for? We're happy to help with sizing, orders and returns."
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 13px.
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Colour: muted grey olive (#858575).
    
    Maximum width: 370px.
    
    Margin-top: 16px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 25px., 3. CONTACT BUTTONS
    
    Create two horizontally aligned pill-shaped buttons below the description.
    
    Button 1 – WhatsApp
    
    Text: "Chat on WhatsApp"
    
    Background: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Text colour: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Small white WhatsApp/chat icon on the left.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Border radius: 30px.
    
    No heavy shadow.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the store's configurable WhatsApp contact number.
    
    Use a Shopify theme setting for the WhatsApp number.
    
    Open WhatsApp in a new tab.
    
    Use a properly formatted wa.me link.
    
    Button 2 – Email Us
    
    Text: "Email us"
    
    Transparent background.
    
    Thin olive border (#A8AD91).
    
    Dark olive text.
    
    Small envelope icon on the left.
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Border radius: 30px.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the configurable customer support email address using a mailto link.
    
    Button spacing: 10px.
    
    4. RIGHT COLUMN – FAQ ACCORDION
    
    Create exactly SIX accordion items stacked vertically.
    
    The accordion must have the same appearance as the reference screenshot.
    
    ACCORDION STRUCTURE
    
    Each accordion item:
    
    Full available column width.
    
    White background (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 14px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    No heavy shadow.
    
    Minimum height when collapsed: 62px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 22px.
    
    Vertical padding: 16px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 9px.
    
    Each question must be left aligned.
    
    Each expand/collapse button must be positioned at the far right., QUESTION 1
    
    Question:
    "Is delivery really free?"
    
    Answer:
    "Yes. Delivery is free on every order, and you can choose cash on delivery at checkout if you'd rather pay when your parcel arrives."
    
    Default state: EXPANDED.
    
    Design:
    
    Show the answer beneath the question.
    
    Circular dark olive button on the right.
    
    White minus icon.
    
    Expanded card height approximately 105px.
    
    QUESTION 2
    
    Question:
    "How do returns work?"
    
    Answer:
    "We want you to love every Kiss and Kry purchase. If something isn't right, contact our support team within the applicable return period and we'll guide you through the return or exchange process."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 3
    
    Question:
    "How do I choose the right size?"
    
    Answer:
    "Check our size guide before ordering. It includes measurements and fit guidance to help you choose the right size for your little one. If you're unsure, contact us and we'll help."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 4
    
    Question:
    "What is bamboo viscose?"
    
    Answer:
    "Bamboo viscose is a soft, smooth fabric made from bamboo-derived cellulose. It has a gentle feel and comfortable drape, making it a lovely choice for everyday babywear."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 5
    
    Question:
    "Is bamboo suitable for newborns?"
    
    Answer:
    "Our bamboo viscose babywear is designed with softness and comfort in mind. Choose the appropriate size and follow the garment's care instructions for everyday use."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 6
    
    Question:
    "How should I wash my Kiss and Kry pieces?"
    
    Answer:
    "Machine wash at 30°C or below on a gentle cycle, preferably inside out. Use mild baby-safe detergent, avoid bleach and fabric softener, and dry in the shade."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    5. ACCORDION TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Question text:
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 13px.
    
    Colour: dark charcoal olive (#555849).
    
    Line height: 1.4.
    
    Answer text:
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Colour: muted grey olive (#858575).
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Margin-top: 10px.
    
    Maximum width: 95%.
    
    Maintain consistent typography and spacing across all six items.
    
    6. ACCORDION ICONS
    
    Each accordion item must have a circular toggle button at the far right.
    
    Collapsed state:
    
    White background.
    
    Thin light-grey olive border.
    
    Small olive plus (+) icon.
    
    Approximately 24px × 24px.
    
    Expanded state:
    
    Dark olive background (#626B4C).
    
    White minus (−) icon.
    
    Approximately 24px × 24px.
    
    Icon specifications:
    
    Use inline SVG.
    
    Keep icons perfectly centred.
    
    Circular shape.
    
    Smooth transition when toggled.
    
    7. FUNCTIONAL ACCORDION BEHAVIOUR
    
    This must be a real interactive accordion, not a static visual.
    
    Clicking a question expands its answer.
    
    Clicking the same question again collapses it.
    
    Use a single-open-item accordion behaviour: opening another question automatically closes the previous one.
    
    Question 1 must be expanded by default when the page loads.
    
    Update the plus/minus icons according to the active state.
    
    Use smooth, subtle height transitions.
    
    Ensure keyboard accessibility.
    
    Use appropriate ARIA attributes.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign whatsapp_number = block.settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' | remove: '-' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '.' %}
{% style %}
  {{ settings.type_body_font | font_face }}
  {{ settings.type_heading_font | font_face }}
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:{{ block.settings.background_color }}; padding:75px 60px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:42fr 58fr; gap:45px; align-items:start; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro { min-width:0; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow { margin:0 0 13px; color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:10px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:2px; line-height:1.4; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { max-width:400px; margin:0; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_heading_font.family }},{{ settings.type_heading_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:38px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.08; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description { max-width:370px; margin:16px 0 25px; color:{{ block.settings.description_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button { min-height:42px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; padding:0 20px; border:1px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; border-radius:30px; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--whatsapp { background:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; color:#FFFFFF; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--email { background:transparent; border-color:#A8AD91; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button svg { width:15px; height:15px; flex:0 0 15px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:focus-visible,.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question:focus-visible { outline:2px solid {{ block.settings.heading_color }}; outline-offset:4px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { min-width:0; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item { margin-bottom:9px; border-radius:14px; background:#FFFFFF; overflow:hidden; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question { width:100%; min-height:62px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; padding:16px 22px; border:0; background:#FFFFFF; color:#555849; text-align:left; cursor:pointer; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.4; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle { width:24px; height:24px; flex:0 0 24px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid #D3D5CA; border-radius:50%; background:#FFFFFF; color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; transition:background-color .22s ease,color .22s ease,border-color .22s ease; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle svg { display:block; width:12px; height:12px; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question[aria-expanded='true'] .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle { background:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; color:#FFFFFF; border-color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }}; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel { max-height:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height .28s ease,opacity .2s ease; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-inner { padding:10px 22px 19px; max-width:95%; color:{{ block.settings.answer_color }}; font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},{{ settings.type_body_font.fallback_families }}; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; }
  .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-inner p { margin:0; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle,.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel { transition:none; } }
  @media screen and (max-width:749px) { .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:48px 22px; } .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width:100%; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:30px; } .ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size:32px; } }
{% endstyle %}
<faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">
      <p class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2>
      <p class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>
      <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions">
        {% if whatsapp_number != blank %}<a class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/{{ whatsapp_number }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp (opens in a new tab)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-12.4 7.4L3 20l1.2-4.4A8.4 8.4 0 1 1 20 11.5Z"/><path d="M8.5 8.5c.4 2.2 2.2 4 4.5 4.5"/></svg><span>Chat on WhatsApp</span></a>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.support_email != blank %}<a class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button--email" href="mailto:{{ block.settings.support_email | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg><span>Email us</span></a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list">
      {% for i in (1..6) %}
        {% liquid
          assign question_key = 'question_' | append: i
          assign answer_key = 'answer_' | append: i
          assign question_text = block.settings[question_key]
          assign answer_text = block.settings[answer_key]
          assign initial_expanded = false
          if i == 1
            assign initial_expanded = true
          endif
        %}
        <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item">
          <button class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question" id="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}" type="button" aria-expanded="{% if initial_expanded %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" aria-controls="ai-faq-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}"><span>{{ question_text | escape }}</span><span class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6h8"/><path class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__vertical" d="M6 2v8"/></svg></span></button>
          <div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel" id="ai-faq-panel-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ i }}" {% unless initial_expanded %}inert{% endunless %}><div class="ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__panel-inner">{{ answer_text }}</div></div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    (() => {
      class FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
        connectedCallback() {
          this.buttons = [...this.querySelectorAll('.ai-faq-{{ ai_gen_id }}__question')];
          this.buttons.forEach((button) => {
            const panel = this.querySelector(`#${button.getAttribute('aria-controls')}`);
            if (button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true') {
              panel.style.maxHeight = `${panel.scrollHeight}px`;
              panel.style.opacity = '1';
              panel.inert = false;
            }
            button.addEventListener('click', () => this.toggle(button));
          });
        }
        toggle(selected) {
          this.buttons.forEach((button) => {
            const panel = this.querySelector(`#${button.getAttribute('aria-controls')}`);
            const shouldOpen = button === selected && button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') !== 'true';
            button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(shouldOpen));
            if (shouldOpen) {
              panel.inert = false;
              panel.style.maxHeight = `${panel.scrollHeight}px`;
              panel.style.opacity = '1';
            } else {
              panel.style.maxHeight = `${panel.scrollHeight}px`;
              requestAnimationFrame(() => { panel.style.maxHeight = '0px'; panel.style.opacity = '0'; });
              panel.inert = true;
            }
          });
        }
      }
      const tagName = 'faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
      if (!customElements.get(tagName)) customElements.define(tagName, FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }});
    })();
  </script>
</faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Minimal FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Introduction" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "— FAQ" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Questions?\nWe've Got Answers." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "description", "label": "Description", "default": "Can't find what you're looking for? We're happy to help with sizing, orders and returns." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "whatsapp_number", "label": "WhatsApp number", "info": "Include country code; formatting characters are removed automatically." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "support_email", "label": "Support email" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "FAQ items" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_1", "label": "Question 1", "default": "Is delivery really free?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_1", "label": "Answer 1", "default": "<p>Yes. Delivery is free on every order, and you can choose cash on delivery at checkout if you'd rather pay when your parcel arrives.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_2", "label": "Question 2", "default": "How do returns work?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_2", "label": "Answer 2", "default": "<p>We want you to love every Kiss and Kry purchase. If something isn't right, contact our support team within the applicable return period and we'll guide you through the return or exchange process.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_3", "label": "Question 3", "default": "How do I choose the right size?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_3", "label": "Answer 3", "default": "<p>Check our size guide before ordering. It includes measurements and fit guidance to help you choose the right size for your little one. If you're unsure, contact us and we'll help.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_4", "label": "Question 4", "default": "What is bamboo viscose?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_4", "label": "Answer 4", "default": "<p>Bamboo viscose is a soft, smooth fabric made from bamboo-derived cellulose. It has a gentle feel and comfortable drape, making it a lovely choice for everyday babywear.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_5", "label": "Question 5", "default": "Is bamboo suitable for newborns?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_5", "label": "Answer 5", "default": "<p>Our bamboo viscose babywear is designed with softness and comfort in mind. Choose the appropriate size and follow the garment's care instructions for everyday use.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "question_6", "label": "Question 6", "default": "How should I wash my Kiss and Kry pieces?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "answer_6", "label": "Answer 6", "default": "<p>Machine wash at 30°C or below on a gentle cycle, preferably inside out. Use mild baby-safe detergent, avoid bleach and fabric softener, and dry in the shade.</p>" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background_color", "label": "Background", "default": "#F5F3E7" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "heading_color", "label": "Heading", "default": "#626B4C" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "eyebrow_color", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "#777D5D" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "description_color", "label": "Body text", "default": "#666657" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "answer_color", "label": "Answer text", "default": "#858575" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Minimal FAQ" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "minimal-faq-block"
}
{% endschema %}